  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened water security in Brazil with the IHP support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This element will support the implementation of IHP-IX in Brazil, based on its Strategic and Operational Implementation Plans, with a focus on accelerating change towards the targets of SDG6. It will work closely with IHP working groups, UNESCO Chairs and UNESCO Centres in the country to address priority areas in (1) scientific research and innovation, (2) water education in Fourth Industrial Revolution including sustainability, (3) bridging the data-knowledge gap, (4) integrated water resources management under conditions of global change, and (5) water governance based on science for mitigation, adaptation, and resilience. It will also support regional working groups working on cryosphere and forest systems, while promoting intersectoral and interagency cooperation.</narrative>
  </description>
